---
import RoundedGrid from "../assets/RoundedGrid.astro";
---

<section class="relative overflow-hidden border-t border-white/5">
  <RoundedGrid />

  <div class="relative px-8 py-12 mx-auto max-w-7xl md:px-12 lg:px-16 lg:py-24">
    <div class="relative items-center">
      <div
      class="grid grid-cols-1 gap-8 mt-6 sm:grid-cols-2 lg:gap-24 items-center">
      <div class=" ">
        <!--<h2>
          Unified Multicurrency Dashboard
        </h2>-->
         <p class="text-xl italic"><span class="text-3xl text-white">"</span> We've had an outstanding experience working with the 99minds team. They were incredibly responsive and acted as true partners throughout the implementation process. From day one, they worked closely with our business, product, and engineering teams to understand our goals and delivered a large number of customizations quickly and accurately. Their ability to meet tight deadlines and adapt to our evolving needs was impressive. Thanks to 99minds, we were able to launch a tailored loyalty & giftcard program, and multi-currency omnichannel physical & digital gift cards -- all on time and issue-free.<span class="text-3xl text-white">"</span> <br /><br />Review on Shopify App Store <br /><img
              role="img"
              class="mt-4"  width="250px" height="auto"
              src="/assets/multicurrency/CM_logo-w.svg"
              alt="Club Monaco"
            /></p> 
      </div>
      <div class="h-full">
        <h2>
          Leading Omnichannel Gifting & Loyalty Platform
        </h2>
         <p class="mt-4">99minds helps retailers enhance customer relationships through integrated loyalty, gift card, and store credit solutions.</p> 
         <div class="flex flex-col sm:flex-row gap-4 mt-10 justify-left items-center">
          <button 
            type="button" 
            role="button" 
            label="book a demo"
            class="raise relative p-0.5 inline-flex items-center justify-center font-bold overflow-hidden group rounded-md"
            onclick="Calendly?.initPopupWidget({ url: 'https://calendly.com/99minds/30min' });"
          >
            <span class="w-full h-full bg-gradient-to-br from-[#ff8a05] via-[#ff5478] to-[#ff00c6] group-hover:from-[#ff00c6] group-hover:via-[#ff5478] group-hover:to-[#ff8a05] absolute"></span>
            <span class="relative px-4 py-2 transition-all ease-out bg-gray-900 bg-opacity-0 rounded-md group-hover:bg-opacity-10 duration-400 font-medium">
              <span class="relative text-white">Book a Demo</span>
            </span>
          </button>
        
          <a 
            href="https://apps.shopify.com/99minds-gift-card-loyalty-referral#" 
            target="_blank" 
            class="raise relative p-0.5 inline-flex items-center justify-center font-bold overflow-hidden group rounded-md font-medium"
          >
            <span class="w-full h-full bg-gradient-to-br from-[#ff8a05] via-[#ff5478] to-[#ff00c6] group-hover:from-[#ff00c6] group-hover:via-[#ff5478] group-hover:to-[#ff8a05] absolute"></span>
            <span class="relative px-4 py-2 transition-all ease-out bg-gray-900 bg-opacity-0 rounded-md group-hover:bg-opacity-10 duration-400">
              <span class="relative text-white">Install On Shopify</span>
            </span>
          </a>
        </div>
        
      </div>
    </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
